  "description": "The record: u16 version 2, the parks and the zoos (u32 count + references of class 0xA9BD882D, null entries kept). write -> read -> write is byte-identical; versions 1 and 3 are rejected; a cut record is refused and gives back the references it took; an unresolvable reference reads as null; a count of 10,000,000 or more reads nothing further for that list. Read replaces the lists without releasing the old entries and touches neither the latch nor the department, which Init finds again by ID. Synthetic stand-ins for the corpus (the saves are not available to this suite): the empty 10-byte record and records with 1, 3, 6 and 9 parks and no zoo round-trip.",
